sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as Request (trace T)
    participant UoW as UnitOfWork
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant D as OutboxDispatcher (background, any instance)
    participant B as Broker
    API->>UoW: SaveChanges (the quote raised QuoteCreated)
    UoW->>DB: one transaction: quote, history, key + outbox_messages row (trace_parent = T)
    Note over API,DB: the change and its event are stored together or not at all
    loop every 2 s
        D->>DB: claim: UPDATE … SET locked_until, lock_token WHERE id IN (SELECT due … FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED) RETURNING *
        Note over D,DB: one short statement, committed at once: no lock held while publishing
        D->>B: publish (span "quotes.quote-created.v1 publish", child of T)
        alt published
            D->>DB: processed_at = now, release lease … WHERE lock_token = ours
        else failed
            D->>DB: attempts + 1, next_attempt_at = now + backoff … WHERE lock_token = ours
        end
    end
    Note over D,DB: a dispatcher that dies: its lease expires and another instance reclaims the message
